Our third update for Out of Line! We will continue to update the game, find more issues and fix all the bugs reported. Your support is what drives us in continuing to further improve the game!

[h3]Fixed Several Bugs and Visual Glitches Throughout the Game[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed several bugs and visual glitches throughout the game;
[*] Fixed an issue with skipping certain puzzles that could cause syncing problems;
[*] Fixed an issue with claws detecting San but not attacking;
[*] Fixed issue with sound not stopping or not restarting properly
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39113280/2cabfc042f666d5eac129db3ecb76c7773cc6236.png[/img]
Our second update for Out of Line! We will continue to update the game, find more issues and fix all the bugs reported. Your support is what drives us in continuing to further improve the game!

[h3]Fixed Several Bugs and Visual Glitches Throughout the Game[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed several bugs and visual glitches throughout the game;
[*] Fixed several collision issues on elevators;
[*] Fixed issues with San being able to enter certain walls;
[*] Fixed issue with spiders not attacking San, when not under the light.
[/list][h3]Localization updates[/h3]
[list]
[*] Localization updates in: Russian;
[*] Updated credits
[/list]

[img]https://i.imgur.com/gjPzEGF.png[/img]

We are happy to announce our very first patch notes for Out of Line. We would like to thank everyone for all the support. We could not have done it without you. We will continue to update and fix more issues found in the future

[h2]Fixed several bugs and visual glitches throughout the game[/h2]

[list]
[*] Fixed bug with the meta achievement “Out of Line” not triggering - reentering the game should unlock the achievement if the remaining achievements are unlocked;
[*] Fixed a bug where the lever tutorial could be ignored;
[*] Fixed several sound issues;
[*] Localization updates in: German, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese and Japanese;
[*] Disconnecting a controller should now pause the game.
[/list]
[h2]Steam-Specific[/h2]

[list]
[*] Opening the overlay should now pause the game;
[*] Out of Line now includes a controller recommended configuration.
[/list]
